#: src/requiring-confirmation-for-recipes.md:1
msgid "Requiring Confirmation for Recipes"
msgstr ""

#: src/requiring-confirmation-for-recipes.md:3
msgid ""
"`just` normally executes all recipes unless there is an error. The "
"`[confirm]` attribute<sup>1.17.0</sup> allows recipes to require "
"confirmation in the terminal prior to running. This can be overridden by "
"passing `--yes` to `just`, which will automatically confirm any recipes "
"marked by this attribute."
msgstr ""

#: src/requiring-confirmation-for-recipes.md:8
msgid ""
"Recipes dependent on a recipe that requires confirmation will not be run if "
"the relied upon recipe is not confirmed, as well as recipes passed after any "
"recipe that requires confirmation."
msgstr ""

#: src/requiring-confirmation-for-recipes.md:18
msgid "Custom Confirmation Prompt"
msgstr ""

#: src/requiring-confirmation-for-recipes.md:20
msgid ""
"The default confirmation prompt can be overridden with "
"`[confirm(PROMPT)]`<sup>1.23.0</sup>:"
msgstr ""

#: src/requiring-confirmation-for-recipes.md:23
msgid ""
"```just\n"
"[confirm(\"Are you sure you want to delete everything?\")]\n"
"delete-everything:\n"
"  rm -rf *\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/requiring-confirmation-for-recipes.md:29
msgid ""
"The confirmation prompt may also be an expression<sup>1.49.0</sup> which may "
"reference assignments or recipe arguments:"
msgstr ""

#: src/requiring-confirmation-for-recipes.md:32
msgid ""
"```just\n"
"[confirm(\"Deploy to \" + env + \"?\")]\n"
"deploy env:\n"
"  echo 'Deploying to {{env}}...'\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
